WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.557
Column pruning is the column version of the same idea.

00:00:03.557 --> 00:00:09.357
If a dataset has one hundred columns but your transformation needs only five,

00:00:09.357 --> 00:00:13.917
a columnar format can often avoid reading the other ninety-five.

00:00:13.917 --> 00:00:19.742
This is one reason I do not want you to develop the habit of always selecting every column.

00:00:19.742 --> 00:00:24.957
During quick exploration, selecting all columns may be convenient.

00:00:24.957 --> 00:00:29.729
In a large production transformation, choose the columns you actually need.
